---
const connections = [
  { from: 'Facility & hardware', to: 'Power, thermals, and the limits of the machine.' },
  { from: 'Kernels & runtimes', to: 'How the workload turns resources into useful work.' },
  { from: 'Scheduling', to: 'Where work runs, when it runs, and what it waits for.' },
];
---
<section class="system-section container" id="system" aria-labelledby="system-title">
  <div class="system-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="index">01 /</span> The whole picture</p>
    <h2 id="system-title">The bottleneck rarely<br />stays in one layer.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="system-story">
    <p class="story-lead">A slow kernel can be a memory problem. A slow node can be a thermal problem. A slow workload can be a scheduling problem.</p>
    <p class="story-body">Engineers are left to connect those dots across fragmented tools. Strided is being built to treat the data center as one system, with a traceable path from the signal to the cause to the change.</p>
    <dl class="connections">
      {connections.map(item => <div><dt>{item.from}</dt><dd>{item.to}</dd></div>)}
    </dl>
    <p class="scope-note"><span aria-hidden="true">↳</span> Our starting point: causal diagnosis for LLM inference.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .system-section { padding-block: var(--section-space); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; }
  .system-heading .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .system-story { padding-top: 42px; }
  .story-lead { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.45; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .story-body { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; margin-top: 21px; max-width: 520px; }
  .connections { margin: 30px 0 0; }
  .connections > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 145px 1fr; gap: 20px; padding: 16px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 12px; }
  dt { font-weight: 500; }
  dd { margin: 0; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .scope-note { font: 10px/1.8 var(--font-mono); color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 20px; }
  .scope-note span { margin-right: 8px; }
  @media (max-width: 950px) { .system-section { gap: 40px; } .connections > div { grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr; gap: 14px; } }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .system-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; } .system-story { padding-top: 0; } .story-lead { font-size: 25px; } }
</style>
